 #### Bonuses (AI)
 
-- **Strategic bonus “AI Objective” weighting (rework):** Now assign non-zero `iAIObjective` to key bonuses (Copper, Iron, Horse, Camel, Aluminum, Uranium). In base AdvCiv these were `0`, so logic that referenced them did nothing; now they actually tip decisions. We also added code paths that consume these weights: (1) **city-site scoring** (`AIFoundValue::evaluate`) — extra-value candidate sites that have these bonuses in their BFC; (2) **worker build priority** (`CvUnitAI::AI_bestCityBuild`) — e.g., improve/connect Copper before Stone; (3) **which city to improve next** (`CvUnitAI::AI_nextCityToImprove`) — prefer cities with unconnected high-objective bonuses. Display added in Sevopedia Bonus pages; see there or XML for details.
